rgin  there is an area of purplish discoloration  0 4 x  0 3cm    At 11 o clock and 9 7cm from the nipple and less than 0 7cm from  the margin is a recent healing incision which measures 3 5cm  Inferiorly and  laterally  4 o clock   there are numerous small elevated  red to purple lesions  which measure up to 0 4cm in maximum dimension and extend within 0 2cm of the  resection margin  In addition throughout the inferior portion of the specimen  are numerous non pigmented papules which grossly resemble seborrheic keratoses   The largest measure REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 1cm  At the deep surface of the specimen  laterally is a portion of muscle  2 5 x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm    The specimen has been  marked by the surgeon with a suture at the lateral aspect  The specimen is  inked per pathology protocol for the evaluation of margins  posterior   black   anterior   blue  superior   red  inferior   green  lateral   yellow  medial    orange  The breast tissue is focally fibrotic  The biopsy cavity and the mass  lesions are not identified grossly   Micro REMOVED_DATE  scar and 5 9cm from the nipple  11 o clock  4 frags  ESS   Micro 4  adjacent area of purplish discoloration  2 frags  ESS   Micro REMOVED_DATE  scar 11 o clock  9 7cm from the nipple including superomedial  margin  3 frags  RSS   Micro 8  lesion 10 o clock  2 frags  ESS   Micro 9  area of purplish discoloration  8 o clock  2 frags  ESS   Micro 10  largest possible seborrheic keratosis 8 o clock  1 frag  RSS   Micro 11  lesion  inferior margin  8 o clock  1 frag  ESS   Micro 12  lesion inferior margin 8 o clock  2 frags  ESS   Micro 13  possible angioma inferior margin 6 o clock   Micro 14  superficial margin 12 o clock   Micro 15  superficial margin 1 o clock   Micro 16  superficial margin 3 o clock   Micro 17  superficial margin 5 o clock   Micro 18  superficial margin 9 o clock   Micro 19  superficial margain 10 o clock  1 frag  RSS   Micro 20  well healed scar at 2 3cm from the nipple  1 frag  RSS   Mi