n pink soft tissue  The outer surface is smooth to irregular  The inner surface lining is tan pink  smooth and glistening  The wall ranges from  0 1cm to 0 2cm  Representative sections are submitted in cassette B  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left side breast implant   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm disrupted breast implant containing clear gelatinous to rubbery material  consistent with silicone  The area of disruption measures 6 0cm in length  The outer surface is unremarkable with no soft tissue identified  There is a centrally located inscription reading McGann 330 cc  A photograph is taken  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right ruptured breast implant   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm disrupted breast implant  The disrupted area measures 5 0cm x 2 0cm  The remaining contents consist of clear gelatinous to rubbery material consistent with silicone  The outer surface is unremarkable with no attached soft tissue  There is a centrally located inscription reading McGann 330 cc  A photograph is taken  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  RESIDENT FREE SERVICE  JHE                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Jonathan Michael Winograd  M D  PART A  BREAST LEFT  CAPSULE  EXCISION PART B  BREAST RIGHT  CAPSULE  EXCISION PART C  BREAST RIGHT  PROSTHESIS  EXCISION PART D  BREAST LEFT  PROSTHESIS  EXCISION , Well_differentiated_(grade_I).
